{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "eaa701f628a14ddd9a3390f70ad316f8", "name": "11", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To answer this question, I will follow these steps:\n\n1. Use the `get_filelist` tool to list the files in the directory `benchmark/data/question11`.\n2. Identify the files corresponding to thermal Band 31 and Band 32.\n3. Use the `lst_multi_channel` tool to calculate the Land Surface Temperature (LST) using the identified Band 31 and Band 32 files.\n4. Use the `count_above_threshold` tool to count the number of pixels with LST exceeding 310 K.\n5. Calculate the proportion of the area with LST exceeding 310 K.\n\nLet's start by listing the files in the directory."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "EnnR2VZHm", "name": "get_filelist", "input": {"dir_path": "benchmark/data/question11"}}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 12:05:56"}
