{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "5a4c41c61d67482bb316f0160fe83ed3", "name": "21", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The number of pixels with LST > 300 K is 200105.\n\nNext, we need to count the number of pixels with emissivity < 0.96."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "S6XKvRI0J", "name": "count_above_threshold", "input": {"file_path": "/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question21/lst_emissivity.tif", "threshold": 0.96}}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 13:55:43"}
