{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "aa2f72f53bc6461c944dd0d01bacd834", "name": "21", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The total number of pixels in the image is 2160302400.0.\n\nThe percentage of urban pixels that meet the criteria (LST > 300 K and emissivity < 0.96) is calculated as follows:\n\n\\[ \\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{200105}{2160302400.0} \\right) \\times 100 = 0.00926\\% \\]\n\n<Answer>B.28.67%<Answer>"}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 13:55:43"}
