{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "6c61ebd554b24c3c9f6552b4be752769", "name": "41", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The mean ATI values for July 1 and July 15, 2020, are approximately 2.62 and 5.08, respectively. The change in average ATI is calculated as follows:\n\nChange in ATI = ATI (July 15) - ATI (July 1)\n\nChange in ATI = 5.08 - 2.62 = 2.46\n\nThe closest option to this change is:\n\n<Answer>C.Increase by 0.57<Answer>"}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 15:16:57"}
