{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "55f47e24255f48cdb017731540aa7d5f", "name": "49", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The counts of pixels for each drought level are:\n- No Drought (TVDI < 0.4): 3,122,075 pixels\n- Mild Drought (0.4 ≤ TVDI < 0.6): 1,490,535 pixels\n- Moderate Drought (0.6 ≤ TVDI < 0.75): 671,566 pixels\n- Severe Drought (TVDI ≥ 0.75): 671,566 pixels\n\nNext, I will calculate the percentage of area in each drought level."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "cCGnaFbyF", "name": "calculate_area", "input": {"input_image_path": "/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question49/tvdi_2022-08-13.tif", "gsd": 30}}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 15:51:37"}
